  "description": "CR 712.11a, 712.11, 715.3a, 715.2b, 715.2c, 715.3c, 715.4, 120.3a, 702.15b, 115.1, 601.2c, 400.7: Joshua, Phoenix's Dominant transforms into Phoenix, Warden of Fire, a 4/4 flying, lifelink creature Saga; chapters I and II deal 2 damage to each opponent and, the Saga being the source, gain its controller 4 life each (2 from each opponent); chapter III returns any number of target creature cards from its controller's graveyard with total mana value 6 or less, refusing a 7-total set, a noncreature card and another player's card, then returns the card front face up as a new Joshua",
  "note": "Three seats so each opponent is bob and carol and never alice, whose life rises instead; bob's Exquisite Blood then gains bob 2 for carol's loss alone, so a 2 dealt to alice too (net the same for alice under lifelink) would show as bob at 22. Turn 1: Joshua transforms; chapter I takes bob and carol to 18 and alice to 24, and Exquisite Blood returns bob to 20. Turn 4: chapter II takes bob to 18 (then 20 again) and carol to 16, and alice to 28. Turn 7: chapter III refuses Hill Giant, Grizzly Bears and Llanowar Elves (4 + 2 + 1 = 7), Lightning Bolt (not a creature card) and bob's Gray Ogre (not alice's graveyard), and returns Hill Giant and Grizzly Bears (exactly 6), leaving Craw Wurm and Llanowar Elves behind; Phoenix returns as Joshua with no lore counters and its enters trigger discards nothing.",
